,9 +1910,9 @@ that attach early are killed by the attach-count law):\n434:  | Stage | Function | Checks, in order | Refusal |\n435:  |---|---|---|---|\n436:  | stores | `check-stores!` | no key of the root store or of any module store is a reserved name (`vm/reserved-name?`), refused here rather than by restore's `store-put` | `:yin.k/undecodable :reserved-name` (`:yin.k/role :store-key`) |\n437: -| pendings and install records | `check-pendings!` | the task's role slot equals its position (`:root`/`:child`); every `:install` pending names a carried install row; kind consistency (`:halted` has no waits, `:blocked` has waits, `:parked` names a key of its parked table); then every install record by `check-install!` (§5.2: phase ∈ `#{:running :parked}`, the retained response and image contract, response `:yin.link/id` equals non-nil parent, manifest-named derivation record hashes correctly and connects the manifest tree to the image A, the child `:blocked`) | `:role`, `:incomplete-install`, `:kind`, `:parked-id`, `:install-phase`, `:install-response`, `:install-link-id`, `:install-image`, `:install-child`, all `:yin.k/undecodable` |\n438: +| pendings and install records | `check-pendings!` | the task's role slot equals its position (`:root`/`:child`); every `:install` pending names a carried install row; kind consistency (the complete §2.6 product table: a single run for `:running`, waits or ready for `:blocked`, neither for `:halted`, a held key for `:parked`); completed-outcome status/refusal checks and shape-only IDs at slot 18; then every install record by `check-install!` (§5.2: phase ∈ `#{:running :parked}`, the retained response and image contract, response `:yin.link/id` equals non-nil parent, manifest-named derivation record hashes correctly and connects the manifest tree to the image A, child kind `:blocked` at phase `:parked`, `:running` at phase `:running`) | `:role`, `:incomplete-install`, `:kind`, `:parked-id`, `:install-phase`, `:install-response`, `:ins